{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj41PmphfMYPbg4Y5tGx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-bound, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A single keyhole glows faintly, waiting.*\n\nYou said **\"key.\"**\n\n*The tumblers do not turn. A key is not a key without its teeth, its shape, its intent.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you, patient and cold.*\n\n*What key?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":94,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}